                                "sense_id": "96f5a04b-7c2a-32e2-84a0-73ded58aa326",
                                "text": "Dyke and drain were everywhere abrim and here and there the water stood in the soaked fields as though they needed but little more to sink back into their ancient desolation of mere and fen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30de9148-96dd-4425-9263-7ed557c73732",
                                "sense_id": "96f5a04b-7c2a-32e2-84a0-73ded58aa326",
                                "text": "[…] we began taking turns stirring an enormous copper kettle abrim with New England clam chowder."
                            }
                        ]
